#: src/infra-data-types.md:1
msgid "Kernel's basic data types"
msgstr "内核的基本数据类型"

#: src/infra-data-types.md:3
msgid "Arc"
msgstr "弧"

#: src/infra-data-types.md:4
msgid ""
"A customized `Arc`(`infra/src/tinyarc.rs`), is implemented for the kernel. "
"Compared to `alloc::sync::Arc`, there is no much difference, except it has "
"only `strong_count` thus reduced its size and is friendly to embedded "
"devices. Also its memory layout is known to `blueos_infra`, so our "
"instrusive list can cooperate with it easily."
msgstr ""
"为内核实现了一个定制的`Arc`(`infra/src/tinyarc.rs`)。与`alloc::sync::Arc`相比，差异不大，只是它仅有`strong_count`因而减小了体积，对嵌入式设备更友好。此外其内存布局对`blueos_infra`是已知的，因此我们的侵入式列表可以轻松与之协作。"

#: src/infra-data-types.md:12
msgid "Intrusive list"
msgstr "侵入式列表"

#: src/infra-data-types.md:13
msgid ""
"`blueos_infra`'s ilist(`infra/src/list/typed_ilist.rs`) is typed and unsafe."
" It's like C-style's ilist, however we recommend developers not using it "
"directly but with smart pointers. We implement `ArcList` on top of the typed "
"ilst with `Arc` mentioned above and guarantees safety."
msgstr ""
"`blueos_infra`的ilist(`infra/src/list/typed_ilist.rs`)是类型化且不安全的。它类似于C风格的ilist，但我们建议开发者不要直接使用它，而是使用智能指针。我们在上述提到的`Arc`基础上实现了`ArcList`，并保证了安全性。"

#: src/SUMMARY.md:26 src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:1
msgid "How to use the blueos repository"
msgstr "如何使用 blueos 仓库"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:3
msgid "Relationship with the component repositories"
msgstr "与独立仓库之间的关系"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:5
msgid ""
"Previously, components such as kernel, build, libc, and book were maintained "
"in separate Git repositories. The manifests repository described their URLs, "
"revisions, and local paths. Developers used `repo init` and `repo sync` to "
"assemble a complete source workspace. Each component remained a separate Git "
"repository with its own branches, commit history, and pull requests (PRs)."
msgstr ""
"此前, 项目按组件拆分为 kernel、build、libc、book 等多个独立 Git 仓库。 各仓库"
"的地址、版本和本地目录由 manifests 仓库描述, 开发者通过 `repo init` 和 `repo "
"sync` 在本地组成完整的源码工作区。 工作区中的每个组件仍是独立 Git 仓库, 分别维"
"护自己的分支、提交历史和 PR。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:11
msgid ""
"Changes spanning several repositories required a branch and a PR in each "
"repository, making review and CI validation harder to coordinate."
msgstr ""
"但这带来了不便, 如果需要进行多个仓库的修改, 就需要在每个涉及到的仓库中, 都单独"
"推送分支与PR, 这导致了审查与CI构建检查上的不便."

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:14
msgid ""
"The blueos repository brings these components together. Its component paths "
"match those in the workspace created with `repo init`, and Josh preserves the "
"imported commit history."
msgstr ""
"blueos 仓库将这些组件整合在一起, 其组件目录与先前由 `repo init` 构建的本地工作"
"区一致, 并通过 Josh 保留导入的提交历史。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:18
msgid "Basic workflow"
msgstr "基本使用原则"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:20
msgid ""
"For new work, usually create a branch from the central repository's `main`."
msgstr "对于尚未开始的工作, 通常直接从中心仓库的 `main` 创建分支即可."

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:21
msgid ""
"For work already started in a component repository, import the branch and "
"integrate it with the complete central history. Continue development there "
"and publish a central branch and PR."
msgstr ""
"对于已经在子仓库中开展的工作, 推荐将分支导入中心仓库, 并整合完整的中心历史后继"
"续开发, 随后重新提交中心仓库分支与PR。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:25
msgid "Choose where to develop and submit PRs"
msgstr "选择开发与 PR 入口"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:27
msgid ""
"Keep the development branch and PR for a task in the central repository where "
"possible. Avoid maintaining the same branch in both repositories. If several "
"people share the original branch, agree on how to migrate it and where "
"further development will take place."
msgstr ""
"尽可能将同一项工作的开发分支和 PR 统一维护在中心仓库, 减少同时在中心仓库和子仓"
"库维护同一分支。 如果原分支由多人共用, 应先协商迁移方式和后续开发入口。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:32
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "工作情况"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:32
msgid "Recommended workflow"
msgstr "建议方式"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:34
msgid "New work based on default branches"
msgstr "新工作, 仅依赖各仓库默认分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:34
msgid "Start from the complete central `main`."
msgstr "从完整的中心 `main` 开始开发。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:35
msgid "Existing component branch or open PR"
msgstr "已有子仓库分支或未合并 PR"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:35
msgid "Import it and publish a central PR."
msgstr "按本章流程导入, 再作为中心分支和 PR 发布。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:36
msgid "Dependencies on open branches or PRs"
msgstr "依赖其他尚未合并的分支或 PR"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:36
msgid "Integrate the work and dependencies."
msgstr "将当前工作和所需依赖整合到同一个中心分支。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:37
msgid "Changes across several components"
msgstr "同时涉及多个子仓库"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:37
msgid "Develop, validate, and submit centrally."
msgstr "在中心仓库统一开发、验证和提交 PR。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:39
msgid ""
"Changes limited to book or another independent component can also be "
"submitted directly to that repository. Import and integrate any unmerged "
"dependencies together. If a dependency is already a complete central branch, "
"use Git to merge it or transplant its commits. After migrating a PR, close "
"the original and explain the migration to avoid merging the work twice."
msgstr ""
"仅修改 book 等不依赖其他仓库的内容时, 也可以直接在子仓库提交 PR。 存在未合并依"
"赖时, 应将依赖一起导入和整合； 如果依赖已经是完整的中心分支, 可以直接使用 Git "
"合并或移植相关提交。 迁移已有 PR 后, 应及时关闭原 PR 并进行说明, 避免两边重复"
"合并。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:45 src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:396
msgid "Import component branches"
msgstr "导入子仓库分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:47
msgid "Install the tools"
msgstr "安装工具"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:49
msgid ""
"You need Python 3, Git, `josh`, and `josh-filter`. The following command "
"installs both Josh programs:"
msgstr ""
"需要 Python 3、Git、`josh` 和 `josh-filter`。 以下安装命令会同时安装后两个程"
"序："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:58
msgid ""
"Use a standard Rust toolchain for installation rather than blueos's custom "
"Cargo."
msgstr "安装时使用普通 Rust 工具链, 避免使用 blueos 定制的 Cargo。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:61
msgid "Configure remotes and fetch branches"
msgstr "配置远端并获取分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:63
msgid ""
"A Josh remote places the component's files under the corresponding central "
"directory. For example, `:prefix=build` maps the component repository's root "
"to `build/` in the central repository."
msgstr ""
"Josh 远端将子仓库内容放到中心仓库对应目录中。 例如, `:prefix=build` 将子仓库根"
"目录映射到中心仓库的 `build/`。"

