msgid ""
"Configure the remotes you need. Skip remotes that are already configured:"
msgstr "配置所需远端, 已配置过的远端无需重复添加："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:80
msgid "See the [appendix](#appendix) for the complete template."
msgstr "完整模板见[附录](#附录)。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:93
msgid ""
"The remote names `fork-build` and `fork-kernel` are local names you choose. "
"After fetching, select an imported branch using a remote-tracking reference "
"such as `fork-build/branch-name`. Configure upstream repositories the same "
"way, changing the remote name and URL."
msgstr ""
"这里的远端名 `fork-build` 和 `fork-kernel` 是本地自定义名称。 fetch 后可用 "
"`fork-build/branch-name` 等远端跟踪引用选定导入的分支。 配置上游仓库时使用同样"
"的方式, 只需更换远端名和 URL。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:98
msgid ""
"`josh fetch` updates remote-tracking references. It does not move your local "
"development branch or integrate the imported branch into the full central "
"history."
msgstr ""
"`josh fetch` 更新远端跟踪引用, 不移动当前本地开发分支, 也不会自动将子仓库分支"
"整合到完整的中心历史。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:102
msgid "Integrate imported branches with the complete blueos repository"
msgstr "将导入分支整合到完整 blueos 仓库"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:104
msgid ""
"An imported branch contains only its component's files. Integrate it with the "
"central history containing all components before using it as a complete "
"central branch and publishing a central PR."
msgstr ""
"导入分支只包含对应子仓库的内容。 需要将它整合到包含所有组件的中心历史上, 再作"
"为完整的中心分支使用并发布中心仓库 PR。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:108
msgid ""
"The early central history imported the component repositories in stages. In "
"`vivoblueos/blueos`, the commit completing these initial imports is "
"`a0d6549f6078a624dc513d4d2a34f5cf47e02f13`. Usually start from the central "
"`main` or a central branch that already integrates the previous imports. "
"After integration, check that the initial import commit is an ancestor:"
msgstr ""
"中心仓库的早期历史逐步导入了各个子仓库。 在 `vivoblueos/blueos` 中, 完成这些初"
"始导入的提交是 `a0d6549f6078a624dc513d4d2a34f5cf47e02f13`。 通常选择中心 "
"`main`, 或上一轮已经整合完成的中心分支作为起点。 整合后, 可以检查该导入完成提"
"交是否是结果的祖先："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:120
msgid ""
"An exit code of 0 confirms the ancestry. This checks the history "
"relationship; you still need to validate the resulting files and build for "
"your changes."
msgstr ""
"命令退出码为 0 表示祖先关系成立。 这个检查用于确认历史关系, 整合后的文件和构建"
"仍需按修改内容进行验证。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:123
msgid ""
"You can first test a merge or rebase in the component repository. The central "
"repository may contain changes that have not yet been synchronized back, so "
"central integration can still require conflict resolution and validation."
msgstr ""
"可以先在子仓库实验对分支的 merge 或 rebase 更新。 中心仓库可能包含尚未同步回子"
"仓库的修改, 因此中心整合时仍需处理冲突并验证结果。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:127
msgid "Integrate with rebase"
msgstr "使用 rebase 更新导入分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:129
msgid ""
"Use Git rebase to transplant the imported branch's changes onto the central "
"`main`. The examples assume that the component `main` changes excluded by "
"rebase are already present in the central starting point."
msgstr ""
"使用 Git rebase 将导入分支的修改移植到中心仓库的 `main` 上。 示例假定被 "
"rebase 排除的子仓库 `main` 基线修改, 已经包含在中心仓库的整合起点中。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:134
msgid ""
"# Transplant build's miri/allocator branch onto the full central history.\n"
msgstr "# 将 build 的 miri/allocator 分支移植到完整中心历史。\n"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:136
msgid "# The result can now be used as a complete central branch.\n"
msgstr "# 该结果现在可以作为完整的中心分支使用。\n"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:138
msgid "# Add kernel's changes on top of the previous result.\n"
msgstr "# 在上一轮结果上叠加 kernel 的业务修改。\n"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:146
msgid "Integrate with merge"
msgstr "使用 merge 更新导入分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:148
msgid ""
"Merging a raw Josh import into the central `main` also brings in its full "
"history. Changes already synchronized to the central repository can have "
"different SHAs under different transformations, so they may reappear as extra "
"commits in the branch and PR."
msgstr ""
"直接把josh导入的分支 merge 到中心 `main`, 会将导入分支的完整历史一起带入。 已"
"经同步到中心仓库的修改, 在不同转换下可能具有不同 SHA, 因而仍可能作为额外提交出"
"现在分支和 PR 中。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:153
msgid ""
"Use `merge-subtree-branches.py` to handle this mapping. Each invocation "
"integrates one imported branch with a merge. Run it sequentially to import "
"multiple components:"
msgstr ""
"可以使用 `merge-subtree-branches.py` 脚本来处理这个问题. 每次调用时会使用merge"
"方式更新一个导入分支, 可以依次导入多个分支："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:158
msgid "# Import build's miri/allocator branch starting from the central main.\n"
msgstr "# 以中心仓库 main 为起点导入 build 的 miri/allocator 分支。\n"

