#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:179
msgid "Starting central commit; defaults to `main`."
msgstr "完整中心历史中的本轮起点, 默认 `main`。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:180 src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:286
msgid "`--target-branch`"
msgstr "`--target-branch`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:180
msgid "Local central branch to create or append a merge to."
msgstr "中心仓库中要创建或追加 merge 的本地分支名。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:181 src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:287
msgid "`--repo-root`"
msgstr "`--repo-root`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:181 src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:287
msgid "Central checkout; defaults to the script's repository."
msgstr "中心仓库路径, 默认脚本所在仓库。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:183
msgid ""
"`--target-base` accepts branch names, tags, full or unique abbreviated SHAs, "
"and Git expressions such as `HEAD~1`. Both `branch` parameters accept branch "
"names only. The script fixes the starting commit before merging, so `--target-"
"base` may name the target branch itself."
msgstr ""
"`--target-base` 支持分支名、标签、完整或唯一缩写 SHA, 以及 `HEAD~1` 等 Git 提"
"交表达式；两个 `branch` 参数只接受分支名。 脚本在 merge 前固定起点, 因此 `--"
"target-base` 可以与目标分支同名。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:188
msgid ""
"If the target branch does not exist, the script creates it from the starting "
"commit. Otherwise, it appends a merge, and the starting commit must be an "
"ancestor of the target branch or its tip. Existing target commits are "
"preserved; the branch is not reset."
msgstr ""
"目标分支不存在时, 脚本从起点创建分支； 已经存在时追加 merge, 起点必须是目标分"
"支的祖先或自身。 脚本保留目标分支中已有的提交, 不会重置分支。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:193
msgid ""
"Commit tracked changes or save them with `git stash` before running the "
"script. It rejects uncommitted tracked changes and ongoing operations such as "
"merge or rebase. It switches branches and merges in the current working tree, "
"staying on the target branch after success."
msgstr ""
"运行前提交已跟踪文件的修改, 或用 `git stash` 保存。 脚本拒绝已跟踪文件的未提交"
"修改, 以及正在进行的 merge、rebase 等操作。 它在当前工作区切换分支并合并, 成功"
"后停留在目标分支。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:198
msgid "Push changes back to a component branch"
msgstr "将修改推回子仓库分支"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:200
msgid ""
"Skip this section if you will maintain the branch only in the central "
"repository. To continue maintaining a component branch, export its directory "
"with `push-subtree-branch.py`."
msgstr ""
"如果后续只在中心仓库维护分支, 可以跳过这一节。 需要继续维护子仓库业务分支时, "
"使用 `push-subtree-branch.py` 导出对应目录。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:205
msgid ""
"# Select commits between --source-base (excluded) and --source-rev "
"(included).\n"
msgstr "# 选择 --source-base(排除) 和 --source-rev(包含) 之间的提交。\n"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:206
msgid ""
"# Add --push for an actual push, and --force for non-fast-forward updates.\n"
msgstr "# 添加 --push 才会实际推送, 非快进更新需要 --force。\n"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:218
msgid "Choose the export range and component baseline"
msgstr "选择导出范围和子仓库基线"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:220
msgid "Use two central commit parameters to select a range:"
msgstr "用两个中心提交参数指定范围："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:222
msgid ""
"`--source-base`: the central baseline before your changes. Exclude this "
"commit and its ancestors."
msgstr "`--source-base`：业务修改之前的中心基线, 排除该提交及其祖先。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:224
msgid "`--source-rev`: the final central branch tip. Include this commit."
msgstr "`--source-rev`：最终中心分支头, 包含该提交。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:226
msgid ""
"The range is Git's `SOURCE_BASE..SOURCE_REV`. For a merge branch, it also "
"includes merged commits reachable from the tip but not from the baseline. "
"Linear and merge branches therefore use the same selection model. Each run "
"filters one directory, including later changes to that directory made on the "
"final branch."
msgstr ""
"范围是 Git 的 `SOURCE_BASE..SOURCE_REV`。 对于 merge 分支, 它也包含分支头可"
"达、但基线不可达的其他合入提交, 因此线性分支和 merge 分支使用同一种表达方式。 "
"每次只过滤一个目录, 在最终分支上继续开发的相关修改也会包含在导出结果中。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:232
msgid ""
"Both central parameters accept branch names, tags, full or unique abbreviated "
"SHAs, and expressions such as `HEAD` or `HEAD~1`. They are resolved to fixed "
"SHAs at the start. `--source-base` must be an ancestor of `--source-rev` or "
"the same commit. Equal endpoints select an empty range."
msgstr ""
"两个中心参数支持分支名、标签、完整或唯一缩写 SHA, 以及 `HEAD`、`HEAD~1` 等提交"
"表达式, 运行开始时固定为具体 SHA。 `--source-base` 必须是 `--source-rev` 的祖"
"先或自身； 两者相同表示空范围。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:237
msgid ""
"`--target-base` selects the component baseline branch for the replay, usually "
"the PR's target branch. Use it together with `--source-base`. The selected "
"directory in the central baseline must contain the same files as the "
"component baseline. The baselines need not have the same name, and the script "
"does not choose or record the central baseline automatically."
msgstr ""
"`--target-base` 指定子仓库中承接这些修改的基线分支, 通常是其 PR 目标分支。 它"
"与 `--source-base` 必须一起使用。 中心基线在所选目录中的文件, 必须与子仓库基线"
"的文件一致。 两个基线不需要同名, 脚本也不会自动选择或保存中心基线。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:243
msgid ""
"The script replays the filtered range onto the component baseline and uses "
"the result to update `--target-branch`. Only that branch is pushed; when it "
"differs from `--target-base`, the baseline branch stays unchanged. Range mode "
"flattens filtered merges. If replay causes conflicts or changes the final "
"files compared with the source directory, the script returns an error without "
"pushing."
msgstr ""
"脚本将过滤后的范围重放到子仓库基线上, 再用所得结果更新 `--target-branch`。脚本"
"只推送该目标分支； 当它与 `--target-base` 不同时, 基线分支不会被修改。 范围模"
"式会展平过滤后的 merge。 发生重放冲突或最终文件与源目录不一致时, 脚本返回错"
"误, 不会实际推送。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:250
msgid "Preview and push"
msgstr "预演和推送"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:252
msgid "First preview the build export:"
msgstr "先预演 build 的回推结果："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:265
msgid ""
"To export kernel from the same final central branch, change the component and "
"remote:"
msgstr "从同一个最终中心分支回推 kernel, 只需更换目录和远端："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:281
msgid "`--source-base`"
msgstr "`--source-base`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:281
msgid "Excluded central baseline; paired with `--target-base`."
msgstr "排除的中心基线；与 `--target-base` 配对。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:282
msgid "`--source-rev`"
msgstr "`--source-rev`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:282
msgid "Required final central commit; included in the range."
msgstr "最终中心提交, 包含该提交；必填。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:283
msgid "Component name; uses the merge script's directory mapping."
msgstr "子仓库名称, 目录映射与 merge 脚本相同。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:284
msgid "`--target-remote`"
msgstr "`--target-remote`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:284
msgid "Configured target Josh remote name."
msgstr "已配置的目标 Josh 远端名。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:285
msgid "Component baseline branch for the replay."
msgstr "子仓库承接导出范围的基线分支名。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:286
msgid "Component branch to update or create."
msgstr "子仓库中要更新或创建的分支名。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:288
msgid "`--force` or `-f`"
msgstr "`--force` 或 `-f`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:288
msgid "Use Josh's force push for non-fast-forward updates."
msgstr "使用 Josh 普通强推, 允许非快进更新。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:289
msgid "`--push`"
msgstr "`--push`"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:289
msgid "Push after a successful preview; omit for a dry run."
msgstr "预演成功后实际推送；省略时只预演。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:291
msgid ""
"The push script's `--target-base` and `--target-branch` accept component "
"branch names only. The default is a dry run without force. Adding `--force` "
"still only previews the update. Use it when rewritten history requires a non-"
"fast-forward update."
msgstr ""
"回推脚本的 `--target-base` 和 `--target-branch` 只接受子仓库分支名。 默认只预"
"演, 也不强制推送；添加 `--force` 仍然只是预演。 历史重写后需要非快进更新时使"
"用 `--force`."

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:296
msgid "In the output:"
msgstr "输出中："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:298
msgid ""
"`BEFORE (current remote)` shows the component branch fetched before the "
"update."
msgstr "`BEFORE (current remote)` 是本次 fetch 得到的更新前子分支。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:300
msgid ""
"`AFTER (proposed, not pushed)` shows the candidate that has not been pushed."
msgstr "`AFTER (proposed, not pushed)` 是尚未推送的候选结果。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:302
msgid ""
"After checking the preview, add `--push` to the same command. For example, "
"force-push the build branch:"
msgstr ""
"检查预演结果后, 在同一条命令后添加 `--push`。 例如, 实际强推 build 分支："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:316
msgid ""
"`Push completed` appears only after an actual successful push. The script "
"processes committed content without moving the central development branch or "
"modifying the current working tree. Its detached temporary worktree is "
"cleaned up automatically; no temporary branch is created. Filtered results "
"are stored in `refs/export/<remote>/<target-branch>`. Range mode also uses "
"`refs/export-bases/<remote>/<target-branch>`. These helper refs are "
"regenerated on each invocation and do not track push progress together with "
"the import script."
msgstr ""
"只有实际推送成功后才会显示 `Push completed`。 脚本仅处理已提交内容, 不移动中心"
"开发分支, 也不修改当前工作区。 用于重放的 detached 临时工作区会自动清理, 不创"
"建临时分支。 过滤结果保存在 `refs/export/<remote>/<target-branch>`, 范围模式还"
"使用 `refs/export-bases/<remote>/<target-branch>`； 这些辅助引用每次重新生成, "
"与导入脚本没有回推进度联动。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:325
msgid ""
"The examples use the merge result `blueos/miri/allocator`. If you followed "
"the rebase workflow, use `--source-rev blueos/miri/allocator-rebased` instead."
msgstr ""
"示例使用 merge 流程生成的 `blueos/miri/allocator`。 如果采用 rebase 流程, 将 "
"`--source-rev` 改为 `blueos/miri/allocator-rebased`。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:328
msgid "Export the full history"
msgstr "导出完整历史"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:330
msgid ""
"To filter all history reachable from the final commit, omit both baseline "
"parameters and specify only `--source-rev`:"
msgstr ""
"需要过滤最终提交的完整可达历史时, 省略两个基线参数, 只指定 `--source-rev`："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:341
msgid ""
"This mode may retain central import merges and old synchronization commits. "
"To exclude history before your changes, use range mode with explicit "
"baselines. A SHA selects one commit; it does not by itself express the start "
"and end of your changes."
msgstr ""
"此模式可能保留中心导入 merge 和旧同步提交。 希望排除业务修改之前的历史时, 应使"
"用明确基线的范围模式。 SHA 只是选定一个提交, 不能单独表达业务修改的起止边界。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:346
msgid "Get updates from component repositories"
msgstr "从子仓库获取更新"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:348
msgid ""
"`josh fetch` updates component remote-tracking references without moving "
"local development branches. If the branch has migrated and is maintained only "
"centrally, continue using the normal central workflow. If you still need "
"component branch updates, distinguish the following cases."
msgstr ""
"`josh fetch` 更新子仓库的远端跟踪引用, 不移动本地开发分支。 如果分支已经迁移并"
"只在中心仓库维护, 按普通中心仓库分支继续开发即可。 仍需获取子仓库业务分支更新"
"时, 要区分下面两种情况。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:353
msgid "The remote advances normally"
msgstr "远端正常快进"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:355
msgid ""
"For a branch that still uses the original Josh import history, merge the new "
"remote-tracking reference using ordinary Git commands."
msgstr "对于仍沿用josh导入历史的分支, 可以按普通 Git 方式合并新的远端跟踪引用。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:358
msgid ""
"For a development branch already integrated with the full central history, "
"remap or transplant updates first. Directly merging the raw import reference "
"can bring back old history. With the merge workflow, run the import script "
"again using the current central branch as the starting point:"
msgstr ""
"对于已经整合完整中心历史的开发分支, 应先重新映射或移植更新, 避免直接 merge 原"
"始导入引用而带回旧历史。 采用 merge 流程时, 可以以当前中心分支为起点继续调用导"
"入脚本："

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:372
msgid ""
"The script fetches, maps, and merges the source. With the rebase workflow, "
"identify the last imported component commit and transplant only the new "
"changes onto the current central branch. The current component `main` is not "
"necessarily that boundary."
msgstr ""
"脚本会自行 fetch, 再映射和合并来源。 采用 rebase 流程时, 需明确上次已导入的子"
"仓库提交, 将它之后的新修改移植到当前中心分支；当前子仓库 `main` 不一定就是这个"
"边界。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:377
msgid "The remote is rebased or force-pushed"
msgstr "远端发生 rebase 或强推"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:379
msgid ""
"Appending a merge preserves the old version's history in the central branch. "
"To remove commits deleted or rewritten on the remote, integrate the latest "
"component branch again from a complete central baseline. Then replay the "
"local changes and other components' changes that you need to retain."
msgstr ""
"追加 merge 会保留中心分支中原有的旧版本历史。 如果需要移除远端已经删除或改写的"
"旧提交, 应从完整中心基线重新整合最新子仓库分支, 再重放需要保留的本地新增修改和"
"其他子仓库的业务修改。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:384
msgid ""
"Keep the original branch for comparison when rebuilding. Check the commit "
"range, resulting files, and build. This still converts component history to "
"complete central history; a successful fetch alone does not validate the "
"integration."
msgstr ""
"重建时应保留原分支供对照, 并核对提交范围、最终文件和构建结果。 这种更新仍涉及"
"子仓库历史到完整中心历史的转换, 不能只根据 fetch 是否成功判断。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:389
msgid ""
"See [Josh branch tools](https://github.com/vivoblueos/blueos/blob/main/tools/"
"josh/README.md) for the complete parameters and helper ref behavior of both "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"两个脚本的完整参数说明和辅助引用行为见 [辅助分支操作工具](https://github.com/"
"vivoblueos/blueos/blob/main/tools/josh/README.md)。"

#: src/how-to-use-blueos-repo.md:394
msgid "Appendix"
msgstr "附录"

#: src/SUMMARY.md:27 src/prs.md:1
msgid "Submit pull requests"
msgstr "提交 PR"

#: src/prs.md:3
msgid "New work"
msgstr "新工作"

#: src/prs.md:5
msgid ""
"Fork [vivoblueos/blueos](https://github.com/vivoblueos/blueos) and submit a "
"PR using the usual GitHub workflow."
msgstr ""
"fork [vivoblueos/blueos](https://github.com/vivoblueos/blueos), 然后按常规 "
"GitHub 流程提交 PR。"

#: src/prs.md:8
msgid "Existing component PRs"
msgstr "已有子仓库 PR"

#: src/prs.md:10
msgid ""
"For an existing component branch or unmerged PR, follow [How to use the "
"blueos repository](./how-to-use-blueos-repo.md) to import the branch and "
"integrate it with the complete central history before continuing development "
"and publishing a central PR. Include any unmerged dependencies in the same "
"central branch."
msgstr ""
"对于已有子仓库分支或尚未合并的 PR, 参考[如何使用 blueos 仓库](./how-to-use-"
"blueos-repo.md)导入分支并整合完整的中心历史, 然后继续开发并提交中心仓库 PR。尚"
"未合并的依赖也应整合到同一个中心分支中。"

#: src/prs.md:16
msgid ""
"After publishing the replacement central PR, close the original component PR "
"and link to the replacement to avoid merging the same work twice. If the "
"original branch is shared, agree on the migration and where further "
"development will take place first."
msgstr ""
"发布替代的中心仓库 PR 后, 关闭原子仓库 PR 并附上新 PR 的链接, 避免同一项修改被"
"重复合并。如果原分支由多人共用, 应先协商迁移方式和后续开发入口。"
